        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Ncobeni ndaba sinkondonyina beembeli, njoobapa mulandu wambelele zyangu, njoobalesya kweembela imbelele, aboobo beembeli tabakooyoolisanina limbi. Njoovuna imbelele zyangu kumilimo yabo, kuti zitabi limbi zilyo zyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
