        {
          "text": "Ayalo misamu yamumyuunda iyoozyala micelo yayo, anyika iyookuzya zilyo, aboobo bayookala anyika yabo cakutayoowa. Lino bayooziba kuti ndime Jehova ninzootyola zikeyi zyajoko lyabo akubavuna kumaanza aabaabo ibakabanjizya mubuzike. ",
