        },
        {
          "text": "Tabakooyooba limbi lusaalo lwabamasi, abalo banyama baansi tabakooyoobalya. Bayookala caluumuno, taakwe naba omwe uuyoobayoosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
