              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoobabusizya myuunda iizyalisya, aboobo tabakooyoopenzegwa limbi inzala munyika yabo nikuba kusampaulwa limbi kulibamasi. ",
